Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:21:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): trim toolbar imports and support both sheet test
 signatures

Shared cleanup with Mihon 0087. Remove obsolete menu imports from the shared toolbar, including material icons unavailable in the Mihon core module. Use positional shared sheet test arguments because Anikku names its original dismissal parameter differently. Scale held-drag test distances to the viewport, preserving the cancellation and alignment assertions. Production layout, search/selection policy and pager alignment behavior are unchanged.
---
 .../components/material/NavigationToolbar.kt  | 21 -------------------
 .../NavigationChromePagerViewportTest.kt      |  6 +++---
 .../NavigationChromeConsistentToolbarTest.kt  |  6 +++---
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

